This build uses the assassin class with the elite skill  [[gww:Shadow Form|Shadow Form]] to run to the ice imp cave in [[gww:Mineral Springs|Mineral Springs]] and kill Ice Imps for the rare drop [[gww:Icy Dragon Sword|Icy Dragon Sword]].

