== Equipment ==
* Mix of Vitae/radiant (Minimum of 40 energy and 510 health.)
* Enchantment Staff
*Zealous Scythe of Enchanting for energy gain. Asterius' Scythe works well for this.

== Usage ==
* Leave from [[gww:Granite Citadel|Granite Citadel]] and run to [[gww:Mineral Springs|Mineral Springs]].
* Follow the tutorial video to find the path to the imp cave.
* Group up as many Imps as possible and lay waste to them with your skills.

